# Local sales data safety

Sales Excel files stay on the owner’s machine. Treat path handling as a security boundary.

## Path gating

- Resolve user-supplied paths only via `resolve_allowed_path` / `MENUYUKTI_DATA_DIR`
- Reject traversal and paths outside the data dir (see `crates/menuyukti/src/paths.rs`)
- Never open arbitrary absolute paths from tool arguments without that gate

```rust
// ❌ BAD — trust client path
std::fs::read(user_path)?;

// ✅ GOOD — gate then read
let path = resolve_allowed_path(user_path, None)?;
std::fs::read(path)?;
```

## Privacy

- Do not log full sales row contents, PII, or spreadsheet cell dumps at info/default levels
- Prefer paths relative to `MENUYUKTI_DATA_DIR` in tool results and logs
- Do not add network upload, telemetry, or remote storage of POS files
- Auth/secrets (tunnel keys, API keys) never belong in the repo or fixtures
